flowchart TD
Start["**Start** 
User triggers multi objective optimization run"] 
NSGA2_alg["**NSGA2 Algorithm** 
Population based MOO using SBX and PM operators"] 
BufferProblem["**BufferCapacityProblem** 
Defines 6 integer decision variables 
each in {1-10} and objective evaluation"] 
InputVars["**Input Variables** 
6 buffer capacities {1-10}"] 
EvaluateMethod["**Problem._evaluate** 
Builds tasks for each individual 
prepares args for parallel evaluation"] 
MultiprocessingPool["**Multiprocessing Pool** 
Parallel map of evaluation tasks 
n workers configured by problem"] 
EvaluateIndividual["**evaluate_single_individual** 
Runs n replications per candidate 
aggregates avg WIP and avg throughput"] 
Replications["**Replications** 
Number of stochastic simulation runs 
per individual"] 
RunSimWithCaps["**run_simulation_with_caps** 
Constructs simpy model using caps 
creates DelayBuffer and Machine instances 
runs warmup and measurement"] 
SimulationEnv["**Simulation Environment** 
simpy Environment 
part generator and WIP sampler"] 
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer Class** 
Capacity attribute cap from decision var 
delayed put get tokens in_transit"] 
MachineClass["**Machine Class** 
process_time availability mttr capacity 
collects working waiting blocked times 
provides energy metrics"] 
Metrics["**Metrics Returned** 
Throughput and WIP per replication 
Machine energy per station"] 
Objectives["**Objectives** 
f1 minimize WIP 
f2 minimize negative throughput to maximize throughput"] 
ResultCollector["**Collect F Values** 
Assemble objective vectors into out F 
returned to NSGA2"] 
HistoryExport["**Export History** 
Save all generation solutions 
CSV with capacities WIP throughput"] 
End["**End** 
Optimization complete and results exported"] 

Start --> NSGA2_alg
NSGA2_alg --> BufferProblem
InputVars --> BufferProblem
NSGA2_alg --> EvaluateMethod
BufferProblem --> EvaluateMethod
EvaluateMethod --> MultiprocessingPool
MultiprocessingPool --> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual --> Replications
EvaluateIndividual --> RunSimWithCaps
RunSimWithCaps --> SimulationEnv
RunSimWithCaps --> DelayBufferClass
RunSimWithCaps --> MachineClass
SimulationEnv --> DelayBufferClass
SimulationEnv --> MachineClass
RunSimWithCaps --> Metrics
Metrics --> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual --> MultiprocessingPool
MultiprocessingPool --> ResultCollector
ResultCollector --> NSGA2_alg
NSGA2_alg --> HistoryExport
HistoryExport --> End